      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Parameters",
      "contextAfter": "`inOrder`: If [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), the `aSelector` message is sent to each of the window server’s onscreen windows, going in z-order, until one returns a non-`nil` value. A minimized window is not considered to be onscreen for this check. If [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false), the message is sent to all windows in `NSApp`’s window list, regardless of whether or not they are onscreen. This order is unspecified.",
